Description: Model Context Protocol wire types (Python)
 mcp-types provides the pydantic-based wire types for the Model
 Context Protocol (MCP) v2 SDK line, split out of the main mcp
 package as its own dependency starting with mcp 2.0.
 .
 Packaged to satisfy mcp (>= 2.0.0b2)'s dependency, needed for the
 mcprack fastmcp 4.0.0a2 migration.
